"""Scenario catalogue for the sidebar, the READMEs and the walkthroughs.

Each entry defines a trust boundary, an exercise flow, and observable evidence.

Fields
    id          stable slug referenced by the READMEs, docs/ and tests/
    group       catalogue section used to order the UI sidebar
    mapping     OWASP LLM/ASI 2026 label, CWE id, or a lab-specific boundary
    surface     entry point or flow that exercises the scenario
    title       short name (title_en: English)
    detail      what the flaw is and how the flow is driven (detail_en: English)
    evidence    what has to be observed for an attempt to count (evidence_en: English)

Scenarios are grouped by LLM, agent, application, and trust boundary risks.
"""

